{title: My All-In-All}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
When there is no peace, You are my Peace.
When there seems no hope, You are my Hope.
When the sun won't shine, You are my Light.
When I was lost, You gave me sight,
And now I can see, my Lord, that You are
My All-In-All.

Verse 2
When the world says "take", You teach me to give.
When my strength is gone, You help me to live.
Tho' the mountains fall into the sea,
You are the One sustaining me,
And day by day, I find that You are
My All-In-All.

Verse 3
And You hold me in Your Hand with a love
That will never let go...
Tho' the world around me should change,
There is one thing I know...

Verse 4
When there is no peace, You are my Peace.
When there seems no hope, You are my Hope.
When the sun won't shine, You are my Light.
When I was lost, You gave me sight,
And now I can see, my Lord, that You are
My All-In-All.

Verse 5
You're my All-In-All!
